zers</span>, including Muon, the measured exponents are consistent with this relation, and the <span class="search-hit mathjax">optimal</span>-loss envelopes agree with $D^{-1/3}$ across them. The <span class="search-hit mathjax">optimizer</span> sets how fast a model learns per step; tuned <span class="search-hit mathjax">optimally</span>, it changes the prefactor but not the rate at which loss falls per sample.
